+
+### Qwen3-VL P0 — verified correct
+
+| Gate | Status | Evidence |
+|------|--------|----------|
+| `set_enabled(true)` requires canEnable → CANNOT_ENABLE, zero config write | ✅ | model-handlers.ts:347-376 (probe + preflight; `return modelError(...)` before any `setComputerModelFields`) |
