+**1. LICENSE_DOOR_TEXT — no 永久跳过, advertises settings reset** ✅
+- `companion/src/computer/model-license.ts:120,125` now say 跳过 + 「复位许可拒绝」/设置页复位. Grep confirms zero remaining 永久跳过 in the file.
