+**2. validateWsMessage reset_decline** ✅
+- `server.ts:4890-4896`: accepts `reset_decline:true | resetDecline:true` without `accepted`; still requires `source:"settings"`; handler belt re-checks source (model-handlers.ts:296-304 → `INVALID_SOURCE`).
+- Handler reset path (model-handlers.ts:406-414) clears `modelLicenseDeclined`, broadcasts, returns `declineReset:true`; unit-tested. Extension sends `reset_decline:true, source:"settings"`. Tests pass.
