+- L2 always: `capabilityForceConfirm` includes host_cli → `forceConfirm` unconditional (god-mode/auto-approve cannot skip, L-CLI-9); Q5 taint forces L2 on host_cli/host_app after CLI output until next real user turn (adapter injects `__thread_id` and `chatCreate` clears taint only on user turns).
+- Executor three-place gate: security_token required → `validateTokenFor` binds `app|subcommand|canonical(flags,args)` via `hostCliBindingPayload` → token-namespace/`apps.enabled`/kind/enabled checks.
+- `prepareCliExecution`/`resolveCliExePath`: realpath + lolbin + vault + `checkAddAllowed` dual door; manifest-only flags (undeclared rejected), charset/value_regex validation, option-injection guard (leading `-`/`/`/`@`), fixed-arity positionals, dangerous-risk ceiling caps; `execFile` with `shell:false`, env allowlist + secret deny-regex (no `buildChildEnv` reuse), timeout/maxBuffer, `windowsHide`; ANSI-strip + truncate; output routed through `PAGE_CONTENT_TOOLS` as untrusted.
